---
import MarketingLayout from "../../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
import { urls } from "../../lib/urls";
---
<MarketingLayout
  title="Restaurant POS for the UAE"
  description="Vyfoo for restaurants in the UAE: configurable VAT workflows, currency setup, and hardware options for cafés, QSRs, and multi-outlet groups."
  path="/solutions/uae"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/solutions">Solutions</a> / UAE</p>
      <h1>Restaurant operations for the UAE market.</h1>
      <p>Vyfoo supports configurable VAT workflows and AED currency setup for restaurants and restaurant groups operating in the UAE.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What's configurable today</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>VAT-related billing workflows, configured per your registration</li>
        <li>AED currency display and calculation</li>
        <li>Standard restaurant hardware (tablets, Android POS, thermal printers)</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What requires confirmation</h2>
      <p>
        We don't currently claim a verified Arabic-language interface or bilingual Arabic/English receipt layout —
        confirm this requirement with our team before assuming it's included. Local payment gateway and aggregator
        integrations should be scoped individually rather than assumed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--ink">
    <div class="container cta-split">
      <div><h2>Discuss your UAE rollout</h2></div>
      <a class="btn btn--on-ink btn--lg" href={urls.bookDemo}>Book Enterprise Demo</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>
